           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Name of the output file.

Empty, or a bare *, is the scene name. An asterisk anywhere stands in for it, so WIP_* and *_export add a prefix or a suffix. {tokens} fill from the scene and the clock, and {n} is the next free version, so *_v{n:03d} versions every export; anything else is literal.

Hover for the full vocabulary and a live preview.</string>
           </property>
