             </property>
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>Export preset — the whole panel's run configuration under a name: settings, tasks, checks, FBX preset, format, log options.
Pick one to apply it; Save (toolbar) writes the current panel as a preset; the ⋯ menu renames, deletes, or opens the preset folder.
Output directory and filename are per-export and never part of a preset.</string>
             </property>
